  "historyNote": "#6805-B, eff 7-18-98; ss by #8682, INTERIM, eff 7-15-06, EXPIRED: 1-11-07 New. #8922-A, eff 7-1-07; ss by #14534, eff 3-12-26 (formerly Lab 209.02)",
